      "body": "## Basic Information\n- **Website Name**: AI Ghibli Image\n- **Website Domain**: [AI Ghibli Image](https://aighibliimage.com)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee0e2fe7-a4d2-4b80-8beb-0b31215d60ba)\n\n## Introduction\n\n### One-line Description\nA professional AI-powered Ghibli-style image conversion tool that instantly transforms your photos into magical scenes reminiscent of Miyazaki films.\n\n### Extended Description\nAI Ghibli Image is a leading artificial intelligence image conversion tool dedicated to transforming ordinary photos into the unique artistic style of Studio Ghibli. Our platform combines advanced AI technology with a deep understanding of Ghibli artistry to provide users with a simple yet powerful image conversion experience. Whether you're a devoted Ghibli film fan or a designer seeking creative inspiration, our tool helps you create artwork filled with dreamlike warmth. Through multiple Ghibli sub-style options, users can convert photos into artistic styles from classic films like \"Spirited Away\" and \"My Neighbor Totoro\", creating truly unique visual experiences.\n\n## Core Features\n\n### Image Conversion Engine\n- Support for multiple image formats (JPG, PNG, WEBP, etc.)\n- Multiple Ghibli sub-style options (e.g., \"Spirited Away\" style, \"Totoro\" style)\n- Custom parameter adjustments (style intensity, color saturation, etc.)\n- Real-time preview of conversion effects\n",
